vities. Therefore, amino acids play a vital role in coral health, digestion, and vivid coloration with longer polyp extension. Similar to amino acids, vitamins play a vital role in providing corals additional nourishment to support better growth, coloration, and a stronger symbiotic relationship with their zooxanthellae.	5722.50	products/product_2987.jpg	32	AQUAFOREST	2026-09-24 09:27:33.236966+05:30	2026-09-24 09:27:33.241042+05:30	2688
